# "(FREE) Porsche 911 Carrera 4S" by Lionsharp Studios, from Sketchfab
# (CC-BY-SA 4.0: credit the author, and share derived models under the same
# license). tools/fetch_models.sh downloads it with a Sketchfab API token.
# The quarry HDRI's low sun lights the front three-quarter view and throws a
# long shadow to the right.
#
# The file was made for a real-time viewer: its body is a grey metallic paint
# under a separate glossy shell ("coat", 46% alpha with alphaMode BLEND). We
# hit that shell with 46% of the rays (gltf_loader.h), which averages to the
# same blend; the car is dark grey because that is how the file is set up.
# The model is centered on the origin, wheels at y = -0.633: lifted onto the
# ground at 0.

image_width  960
aspect_ratio 16/9
samples_per_pixel 256
max_depth    16

camera lookfrom 5.0 1.3 5.5  lookat 0 0.55 0  vfov 32

environment ../textures/quarry_01_1k.hdr  rotate 130
exposure    -0.5
tonemap     aces

material asphalt principled color 0.35 0.35 0.35 roughness 0.5
ground asphalt

mesh ../models/external/free_porsche_911_carrera_4s.glb  translate 0 0.633 0
